# Project structure — AI Support System

npm workspaces monorepo: **React (Vite) client**, **Express API**, **shared** package. Supabase is used for auth (client: anon key; server: service role).

## Excluded from inventory below

- `node_modules/` (root and package-local)
- `.git/`
- `client/dist/` (Vite build output — regenerated by `npm run build`)

## Top-level directories

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `.cursor/rules/` | Cursor IDE rules (this file, `cursor-rules.mdc`, etc.) |
| `client/` | Frontend SPA (React + Vite + Tailwind) |
| `server/` | Express REST API |
| `shared/` | `@ai-support/shared` — shared constants / types |

