## Important files (quick reference)

- **Frontend entry**: `client/src/main.jsx` → `client/src/App.jsx`
- **API bootstrap**: `server/src/server.js` → `server/src/app.js`
- **Auth + API calls**: `client/src/services/auth.js`, `client/src/services/api.js`, `client/src/services/onboardingService.js`
- **Onboarding**: `client/src/pages/Register.jsx`; steps under `client/src/components/onboarding/`
- **Protected API middleware**: `server/src/middleware/auth.js`
- **Onboarding endpoint**: `server/src/routes/onboarding.routes.js` + `server/src/controllers/onboarding.controller.js`
- **Env samples**: `client/.env.example`, `server/.env.example`

